# =============================================================================
# Generated tabular outputs
# =============================================================================
#
# Analysis outputs belong under results/ and are already ignored above.
# These patterns catch accidentally generated tables elsewhere.

*.xlsx
*.xls

# Do NOT globally ignore CSV files because small configuration/input CSVs
# may later be intentionally included in the repository.


